    "Apple Watch is recommended: it records your sets, laps, speed and route, and brings them here when your iPhone is nearby." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Watch is recommended: it records your sets, laps, speed and route, and brings them here when your iPhone is nearby."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Watch wordt aanbevolen: die legt je sets, laps, snelheid en route vast en laat ze hier zien zodra je iPhone in de buurt is."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rppl logs cable-park wakeboarding sessions. Apple Watch records a full park day (sets, laps, speed, route); on iPhone you can also add a session by hand." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rppl logs cable-park wakeboarding sessions. Apple Watch records a full park day (sets, laps, speed, route); on iPhone you can also add a session by hand."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rppl houdt je kabelpark-wakeboard sessions bij. Apple Watch neemt een hele parkdag op (sets, laps, snelheid, route); op iPhone voeg je een session ook handmatig toe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
